      <div class="about">
        <div class="aText">
          <p style = "font-weight: 800;">The making of my Branding & Website</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            For the website I built it using HTML & CSS coding from the ground up. I used Javascript to implement
            all of the interaction and more in depth animation like the nav bar and project carousel.
            All of this was done with Astro and their content collection framework in order to put it all together
            into a functioning website. It was then deployed using Netlify DNS hosting using Prokbun for the domain.
          </p>
          <p>
            For my personal branding I've always been iterating and changing it as my own cartoony drawing style
            and my physical appearance changed with time.
          </p>
          <p>
            Along with this I made black and white variations, guidelines for my brand, even the animation on the homepage!
          </p>
        </div>
        <ImagePopout alt="Progression of my logo over 5 years!" image={LogoT} w="600px" galleryID="1" />
